{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10123050","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10123050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1012305001:0":{"text":"Okay, now I will start the ritual.","source_cn":"那么，现在，我要开始仪式了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD80DC69A9BD6DF55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1012305002:0":{"text":"<quality_6>Lord of the Winds, so wild and free, I stand before you, as you can see. I hear your breath. I feel your grace. Let me fall into your boundless embrace.</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>风的主宰啊……我立于此地，聆听你...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB3C7677D1A7C22B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1012305003:0":{"text":"<quality_6>May the dust fly in the wind's gentle breeze and whisper my prayers to you with ease.</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>愿无所不在的微尘替我低语，让您知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B094DC2B24FCF9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1012305004:0":{"text":"<quality_6>I am Lorsan, yearning for your aid in awe, in anticipation of your guiding call.</quality_6>","source_cn":"<quality_6>我名为洛桑，期待您的呼唤，请您为...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5922F72DBC81ADAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1012305005:0":{"text":"...!","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1012305005":{"text":"...!","source_cn":"……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA75ECAFA62B2D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1012305006:0":{"text":"... I don't hear anything.","source_cn":"……我什么都没有听到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C0A43C232AB1F7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1012305007:0":{"text":"How could that be...? Did we make a mistake?","source_cn":"怎么会……难道我们的推断出错了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A3337D031EBF10B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1012305008:0":{"text":"No, this just proves that we weren't wrong! This is indeed a test for a Windwhisperer.","source_cn":"不，这恰恰证明了我们的推断没有错！这确实是对风语者的考验。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB917D8EBBFCCEA42","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1012305009:2":{"text":"There are no true airtight walls in this world. Even the most solid rock has crevices filled with air.","source_cn":"这个世界上没有真正密不透风的墙。再坚实的岩壁，也会与空...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC623FED281EB96D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1012305010:0":{"text":"But there's absolutely no sound here. None at all. This means this is not a rock at all!","source_cn":"但这里完全没有声音，一点也没有。也就是说，这不是一块真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A8A1CC326CD58F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1012305011:0":{"text":"It's a barrier created by magic, with the entrance hidden behind!","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1012305011":{"text":"It's a barrier created by magic, with the entrance hidden behind!","source_cn":"——而是用魔法营造的屏障，入口就藏在岩石后！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41646FDC6B83B90D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1012305012:0":{"text":"I just had a thought.","source_cn":"我有一个猜测。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74842F7F8E7D3AB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1012305013:0":{"text":"There are two kinds of butterflies in front of the rock wall. Maybe that's a clue on how to break through the barrier.","source_cn":"岩壁前混杂着两种蝴蝶，这也许是在提示我们……破除屏障的方法。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD2ED549766831852","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1012305014:0":{"text":"One type of butterfly can be removed by swordplay, and the other type needs to be shot by Lyca.","source_cn":"一种蝴蝶，可以被剑术清除，另一种，则需要莱卡击破。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B47FB4934E44DB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1012305015:0":{"text":"What would happen if we combined our efforts against one butterfly?","source_cn":"如果，我们对着蝴蝶合力一击，会发生什么呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE79C6AB2881B3B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1012305016:0":{"text":"We might as well try. Let's do it, Lyca.","source_cn":"不如直接试试。一起上吧，莱卡。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F740CCA8D662311","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"How do we get in?","source_cn":"要怎么进去呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x2454974BC6BE22C9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"How do we get in?","female":"How do we get in?","variant_male_record_index":"61506","variant_female_record_index":"61507","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:7:0:1":{"text":"Anything?","source_cn":"如何？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC5CC8663123B70E2","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Anything?","female":"Anything?","variant_male_record_index":"61504","variant_female_record_index":"61505","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"Lorsan","source":"洛桑","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:莱卡":{"text":"Lyca","source":"莱卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"Eironn","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":21,"localized_text_count":20,"speaker_count":3}}